Z||000026||crash||11-14-2001||07:41 PM||||Well.... yeah dumb perhaps, but still a lot of fun.<BR>The fiero is pretty much beat up. <BR>I am getting in touch with a good friend of mine in the grand rapids area to build up a 3.8 "suppy" then no more stunts.<BR>Although I have always had my mind in rallying. There are a couple dirt roads in lowell that I am really tempted to hit.<BR>Was it dimb to do? Maybe. Would I do it again? once I get the upper dog mount replaced... yes.<BR>But I would do my homework and get the physics going before I did it again. And I will videotape it and take pictures.<BR>A car is a car, If you treat it as a person or a living thing you have serious psychological problems. Don't get me wrong, I love my fiero and there is no other car I would prefer to drive (except an Opel Tirga ss).<BR>But It is supposed to be fun!! <BR>My philosofy is "If the car can take it do it"<BR>||||reg||1
