Z||000034||ChopTop||11-15-2001||10:01 AM||||My philosofy is "If the car can take it do it"<P>The problem is cars aren't living entities, and you are.  A car can be rebuilt, but a human may not be able to be.      <BR>I don't think anyone here is telling you not to live life, what people are basically saying is before you do a stunt make sure you think about what you're doing before you do it, not afterwards when it may be too late.  Even the title of this thread indicates you realized you had put your life in danger.  So if you want to be a dare devil by all means go for it, just make sure you plan first, and be aware of the consequences of your actions to yourself, and to those that love you.       ||||reg||1
