Z||000042||crash||11-15-2001||11:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChopTop:<BR><B>My philosofy is "If the car can take it do it"<P>The problem is cars aren't living entities, and you are.  A car can be rebuilt, but a human may not be able to be.      <BR>I don't think anyone here is telling you not to live life, what people are basically saying is before you do a stunt make sure you think about what you're doing before you do it, not afterwards when it may be too late.  Even the title of this thread indicates you realized you had put your life in danger.  So if you want to be a dare devil by all means go for it, just make sure you plan first, and be aware of the consequences of your actions to yourself, and to those that love you.       </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I completely agree with you. It wasn't a smart choice and that is why I am trying to get the math and specs down to do a fully documented jump stunt in my fiero. I have got the experience (silver lake sand dunes) but never on asfalt where the damages can be serious.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000043||crash||11-15-2001||11:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierowrecker:<BR><B> Hey crash!<BR>Welcome from another crash in Lowell!<BR>A Fiero is pretty stable in the air, I had good lift and distance in my 84 2M4...<BR>And the suspension didn't bend...<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>nice to know of other people around my area!!! I go to 3 mile road in lowell quite a bit. And I go to lowell lanes bowling every once in a while. We will have to meet sometime.<P>And yes, I work in the auto industry so I know fieros are very sturdy cars that is one of the things I love about them. In all car types you have the  junkers the rodders, the customs, the mints and then the guys that simply LOVE to have fun and enjoy taking their cars to the limit knowing that is something happens it is entirely your fault and you can learn from the mistakes.<P><BR>||||reg||1
